{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2022-03-23 09:45:00', 'title': 'ENERGY INDUSTRY SECOND CHANCE PILOT PROGRAM OFFERS UNIQUE OPPORTUNITY AFTER PRISON WHILE BUILDING WORKFORCE OF TOMORROW', 'text': 'PUBLIC-PRIVATE EFFORT IN SOUTH CAROLINA PROVIDES TRAINING AND SUPPORT SERVICES TO HELP REMOVE BARRIERS TO SUCCESSFUL REINTEGRATION FLORENCE, S.C. , MARCH 23, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- A UNIQUE PUBLIC-PRIVATE WORKFORCE EFFORT NEARED A MILESTONE TUESDAY AS PARTICIPANTS IN THE INAUGURAL ENERGY INDUSTRY SECOND CHANCE PILOT PROGRAM – DESIGNED TO REDUCE RECIDIVISM BY REMOVING BARRIERS TO SUCCESS FOR FORMER PRISONERS – WRAPPED UP ON-THE-JOB TRAINING AND PREPARED TO RE-ENTER THE WORKFORCE FULL TIME.'}